  "summary": "A prestigious ceremonial textile from Sumba featuring complex double ikat patterns with symbolic motifs.",
  "description": "Sumba hinggi textiles display intricate geometric and figurative patterns created through the double ikat technique, where both warp and weft threads are resist-dyed before weaving. These cloths were traditionally worn by nobility during important ceremonies and contain cosmological symbols representing status, ancestry, and the spiritual world.",
